Comment: 7,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,受け受け
Comment: 8,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,防守防守
Comment: 7,0:15:16.50,0:15:17.47,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,危ねー
Comment: 8,0:15:16.50,0:15:17.47,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好险
Comment: 7,0:15:17.83,0:15:19.33,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ラウンドツー
Comment: 8,0:15:17.83,0:15:19.33,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,第二轮
Comment: 7,0:15:19.90,0:15:20.82,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,おった　おった
Comment: 8,0:15:19.90,0:15:20.82,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,来了来了
Comment: 7,0:15:42.10,0:15:43.30,Text - JP - UP,,0,0,0,,冴えろ　冴えろ
Comment: 8,0:15:42.10,0:15:43.30,Text - CN - UP,,0,0,0,,醒醒
Comment: 7,0:15:43.30,0:15:43.30,Text - JP - UP,,0,0,0,,それそれ
Comment: 8,0:15:43.30,0:15:43.30,Text - CN - UP,,0,0,0,,看招看招
